        "name": "Copy Steam client libraries next to the server",
        "description": "Copy Steam client libraries next to the server",
        "code": "for %%f in (steamclient64.dll tier0_s64.dll vstdlib_s64.dll) do if exist \"%%f\" copy /y \"%%f\" \"Battalion\\Binaries\\Win64\\%%f\" >nul\r\n",
